No.

76
00:04:02,158 --> 00:04:04,827
-Don't you?
-Yeah, and I took a mental health day.

77
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:07,622
It's like a sick day, but everybody's
too afraid to ask what happened.

78
00:04:07,705 --> 00:04:09,666
So are you on unemployment?

79
00:04:09,749 --> 00:04:10,792
No. I tried to get that,

80
00:04:10,875 --> 00:04:13,336
but it turns out you had to have
had a job before you can get it.

81
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:14,962
So you've never had a job?

82
00:04:15,046 --> 00:04:17,549
I washed some blankets
at this mosque for a little while.

83
00:04:17,632 --> 00:04:18,966
Do you come from money?

84
00:04:19,050 --> 00:04:21,553
-What does that mean?
-All righty, I'm ready, Freddy.

85
00:04:21,636 --> 00:04:23,137
Oh, Randy, you're still here?

86
00:04:23,220 --> 00:04:25,598
We're gonna head to the mall.
Do you wanna tag along?

87
00:04:25,682 --> 00:04:26,849
I've already got my shoes on.

88
00:04:26,933 --> 00:04:28,976
Great. Girls' day plus Randy.

89
00:04:38,277 --> 00:04:39,446
-[Arya grunts]
-[Gus] Uh.

90
00:04:39,529 --> 00:04:42,324
-Uh-huh.
-Oh, wait, wait, wait. It gets worse.

91
00:04:42,407 --> 00:04:44,576
Arya, we should probably get back
to class now.

92
00:04:44,659 --> 00:04:46,369
Wait, come on.
Just watch, watch, watch.

93
00:04:46,453 --> 00:04:48,788
-[door opens]
-Hey, Arya. There you are.

94
00:04:48,871 --> 00:04:51,165
-Oh! Hey, Steven.
-Hey.

95
00:04:51,248 --> 00:04:52,875
-How's it goin'? Denise.
-[Steven] Good to see you.

96
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:53,960
Hello.

97
00:04:54,043 --> 00:04:55,712
Dad, I didn't know you were coming today.

98
00:04:55,795 --> 00:04:59,173
I know. But we have sort of
an important decision to make,

99
00:04:59,256 --> 00:05:01,050
and your mom usually handles this stuff,

100
00:05:01,133 --> 00:05:04,846
but she agreed we should have
a good team meeting about it.

101
00:05:04,929 --> 00:05:05,972
Hi, babe.

102
00:05:06,055 --> 00:05:08,350
Hey, do you think maybe we could do,
like, the team meeting

103
00:05:08,433 --> 00:05:10,101
in 15, 20 minutes, or...

104
00:05:10,184 --> 00:05:11,894
Could we just not do it at all?

105
00:05:11,978 --> 00:05:14,146
[chuckles]
No, we gotta do it right now, hon.

106
00:05:14,230 --> 00:05:16,107
You know, this new hiatus you have

107
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:18,192
opens up some really, really
cool opportunities,

108
00:05:18,275 --> 00:05:21,571
and your mom and I just disagree
on which one's the best.

109
00:05:21,654 --> 00:05:25,241
Yeah, okay, take your time. I'll, uh...
I'll just be back here. Just ignore me.

110
00:05:25,325 --> 00:05:26,368
Thank you.

111
00:05:28,536 --> 00:05:29,579
Arya...

112
00:05:30,121 --> 00:05:32,832
I like Liberty Down.
Isn't that a cool name?

113
00:05:32,915 --> 00:05:35,126
It's a big-budget action movie.

114
00:05:35,209 --> 00:05:36,669
From the people that did Taken.

115
00:05:36,753 --> 00:05:39,046
